{"duration_api_ms":160892,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c6cf1390-93dd-4869-8172-4a62fdfb886b","total_cost_usd":0.219164,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15415,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15750,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":10779},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15415,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15750,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15415},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15750,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15415,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.219164,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":10779,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is one geometry (D≈3.38, b=1.2, cone=70) swept in flight-path angle. Heat flux runs from 227.7k W/m2 at gamma=-1.5 to 274.7k at -3.55, and bondline temperature falls from 418 K to 391.4 K. Three constraints pin this corner. The g limit (about 12) caps gamma near -3.57. The heatshield mass fraction caps D near 3.385. The surrogate hull blocks b>1.2 at cone 70, and cone<70 at b=1.2 gives invalid geometry. Steeper gamma is infeasible (g margins go negative from -3.6), and smaller D or other geometries are dominated. The remaining gains are small refinements of the corner and denser coverage of the front.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-d67ebd910866 to C-27aed1c1ecfd: the front is monotone in gamma (HF 227.7k to 274.7k W/m2, T 418.0 K to 391.4 K) at D=3.38, b=1.2, cone=70.\",\"C-27aed1c1ecfd has g margin 0.003 at gamma=-3.55, and C-c050b796618a is infeasible on max_g at -3.6, so gamma must be no steeper than about -3.57.\",\"C-a201e4576c17 (D=3.384) has mass margin 0.00074, against 0.0031 for D=3.38 and 0.0149 for D=3.36. Extrapolating, the mass limit is at D≈3.385.\",\"C-a201e4576c17 vs C-d20e6439cf38 (same gamma -3.4): D=3.384 gives HF 270620 vs 271070 and T 392.78 vs 392.85. A slightly larger D marginally improves both objectives.\",\"C-3d41ce848a30, C-425c523a5086, C-5b57439845df and C-e605b64e0636 (b>1.2) fail on surrogate extrapolation. C-c708a99f10f1, C-17a9b770e63c and C-a55828a3ab03 (cone 62-67 at D=3.3) fail on geometry. The corner is boxed in.\",\"C-e0059024652c (cone 42, b 0.59), C-029296252ff3 and C-a6b969cef0a0 are dominated or violate mass or g. Moving away from the corner hurts.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies on the data plus prior Sutton-Graves reasoning. Peak heating falls with nose radius (b*D) and with ballistic coefficient. Bondline temperature falls with heat load, which shrinks with larger D and steeper entry. Cone 70 and b=1.2 minimise heatshield area, so they allow the largest D under the mass limit. Peak g is set mainly by gamma. The front is therefore traced by gamma at the largest allowed D, and the best available moves are D=3.384 (marginally lower HF and T) and denser gamma sampling.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Gains from D=3.384 are tiny (about 0.15% HF, about 0.07 K) and the mass and g margins are razor thin, so a few points could be marginally infeasible. The two exploratory points (b=1.15, cone=69.5) risk geometry or hull failure and probably will not beat the front. Interpolated predictions could be off by roughly 0.5 K or 1k W/m2.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-d67ebd910866\",\"rationale\":\"Same gamma as the front's shallow end, D raised to 3.384 for a slight HF and T gain.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227260,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Low-risk marginal dominance of C-d67ebd910866.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-778e71eea891\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -1.65.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.65},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":230230,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.45,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e830c06e5d95\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -1.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233340,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e830c06e5d95\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.8 and -2.0 at D=3.384.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f552e60ec816\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -2.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237660,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.02,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2850bd21d3cf\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -2.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243280,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.43,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2850bd21d3cf\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.25 and -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.375},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246180,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.75,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b48a9ba7e9b0\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249080,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-b48a9ba7e9b0\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.5 and -2.75.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.625},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":252040,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.53,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d6f94b852094\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -2.75.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.75},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":255000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.95,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d6f94b852094\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.75 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.875},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.48,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a00857fd77d0\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260990,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.03,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a00857fd77d0\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.0 and -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.125},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":264000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.68,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-5d027c27cbf1\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.32,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-5d027c27cbf1\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.25 and -3.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269410,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.29,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d20e6439cf38\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.4 and -3.5 at D=3.384.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271825,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.28,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds front density near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-41b2ddb7397c\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -3.5. The g margin is about 0.01, so this should be feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.78,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Marginal dominance of a front point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-27aed1c1ecfd\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.384 at gamma -3.55, with a g margin of about 0.003.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274240,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extreme point of the front, with a slight risk from the g margin.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-27aed1c1ecfd\",\"rationale\":\"Push gamma to -3.565, just inside the g limit, for the lowest-T point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.384,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.565},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.16,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front's low-T end. g is predicted at about 11.99 against a limit of 12.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a00857fd77d0\",\"rationale\":\"Exploratory: slightly lower b and D, cone kept at 70, to measure b sensitivity of HF, T and mass margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether the b=1.2 hull boundary is really the best and how mass margin depends on b.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a00857fd77d0\",\"rationale\":\"Exploratory: cone 69.5 with D reduced to 3.36 to keep the mass fraction feasible, to test cone sensitivity of Cd, HF and T.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the cone dependence near the geometry-validity edge, which might reveal a slightly better trade-off. There is a risk of geometry failure.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":124686,"type":"result","duration_ms":160930,"uuid":"d683baa1-9508-43fe-80fa-f659cdec24fe","ttft_stream_ms":1398,"time_to_request_ms":31,"first_content_frame_ms":1398,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
